<title>USA: BAB Holdings sees acquisition as accretive.</title>
<headline>BAB Holdings sees acquisition as accretive.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>BAB Holdings Inc said Tuesday it expects to complete its pending acquisition shortly of My Favorite Muffin, a transaction president Michael Evans sees as immediately accretive to earnings.</p>
<p>BAB Holdings, a Chicago-based operator of Big Apple Bagels, said the acquisition will add 65 units to its group.</p>
<p>Evans said terms are essentially unchanged from those previously reported.</p>
<p>My Favorite Muffin will retain its name and regular menu. It also will feature products from Big Apple Bagels and Brewster's Coffee.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
